{"id": "S0001", "offset": 0, "section": "abstract", "text": "摘要"}
{"id": "S0002", "offset": 3, "section": "abstract", "text": "本横断面调查分析了 320 名用户的睡眠时长与工作效率的关系。"}
{"id": "S0003", "offset": 34, "section": "abstract", "text": "数据分析表明睡眠不足导致效率下降，所有高强度岗位均受影响。"}
{"id": "S0004", "offset": 63, "section": "abstract", "text": "这一发现为企业排班制度提供了决定性依据。"}
{"id": "S0005", "offset": 85, "section": "introduction", "text": "引言"}
{"id": "S0006", "offset": 88, "section": "introduction", "text": "睡眠与认知表现的关系尚无定论。"}
{"id": "S0007", "offset": 103, "section": "introduction", "text": "本文旨在描述两者在一组企业员工中的关联。"}
{"id": "S0008", "offset": 125, "section": "methods", "text": "方法"}
{"id": "S0009", "offset": 128, "section": "methods", "text": "采用问卷调查收集自报睡眠时长与自评效率评分，做相关性分析。"}
{"id": "S0010", "offset": 157, "section": "methods", "text": "有效样本 n = 320。"}
{"id": "S0011", "offset": 172, "section": "results", "text": "结果"}
{"id": "S0012", "offset": 175, "section": "results", "text": "睡眠时长与效率评分呈正相关，相关系数 r = 0.31。"}
{"id": "S0013", "offset": 203, "section": "results", "text": "分组比较显示短睡组评分较低。"}
{"id": "S0014", "offset": 219, "section": "discussion", "text": "讨论"}
{"id": "S0015", "offset": 222, "section": "discussion", "text": "睡眠不足导致效率下降，因此企业应取消弹性夜班。"}
{"id": "S0016", "offset": 245, "section": "discussion", "text": "我们没有讨论其他可能影响效率的因素。"}
{"id": "S0017", "offset": 265, "section": "references", "text": "参考文献"}
{"id": "S0018", "offset": 270, "section": "references", "text": "[1] 陈 et al., 睡眠与认知, 2018."}
